 the Ch&#39;ing Period/Jirgalang\">Jirgalang</a></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward-arrow\">\u2192</div></div></div><div class=\"wst-header-notes header&#95;notes searchaux wst-unknown-notes\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r14791120\">.mw-parser-output .plainSister{display:block;font-size:93%;line-height:normal;list-style-type:none;list-style-image:none;list-style-position:outside;border:1px solid var(--border-color-interactive--hover,#AAA);float:right;clear:right;margin:0.5ex 0 0.5ex 0.5ex;padding:0;background:var(--background-color-base,#FFFFFF);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}.mw-parser-output .sisicon,.mw-parser-output .dabicon{padding-right:1ex}</style><ul class=\"plainSister\"><li class=\"sisitem\"><span class=\"sisicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix\" title=\"Special:SiteMatrix\"><img alt=\"Sister Projects\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/20px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/40px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix\" title=\"Special:SiteMatrix\">sister projects</a>: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jidu\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Jidu\">Wikipedia article</a>, <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q107367309\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q107367309\">Wikidata item</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"ws-noexport\" id=\"ws-data\" style=\"speak:none\"><span id=\"ws-article-id\">3640934</span><span id=\"ws-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eminent_Chinese_of_the_Ch%27ing_Period\" title=\"Eminent Chinese of the Ch&#39;ing Period\">Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period</a>, Volume 1 \u2014 Jidu</span><span id=\"ws-editor\">Arthur W. Hummel</span><span id=\"ws-author\">George A. Kennedy</span></div></div>\n<p><span style=\"display:none\" id=\"dynamic&#95;layout&#95;overrider\">Layout 2</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\" lang=\"en\">\n<p><span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"397\" data-page-number=\"397\" data-page-name=\"Page:Eminent Chinese Of The Ch\u2019ing Period - Hummel - 1943 - Vol. 1.pdf/409\" data-page-index=\"409\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Eminent&#95;Chinese&#95;Of&#95;The&#95;Ch%E2%80%99ing&#95;Period&#95;-&#95;Hummel&#95;-&#95;1943&#95;-&#95;Vol.&#95;1.pdf/409\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;409\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span><b>JIDU</b> \u6fdf\u5ea6, 1633\u20131660, Aug. 6, member of the Imperial Family, was the second son of <span class=\"ws-authlkpl\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eminent_Chinese_of_the_Ch%27ing_Period/Jirgalang\" title=\"Eminent Chinese of the Ch&#39;ing Period/Jirgalang\">Jirgalang</a></span>&#32;[<i>q.&#8239;v.</i>] and a grandson of <span class=\"ws-authlkpl\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eminent_Chinese_of_the_Ch%27ing_Period/%C5%A0urhaci\" title=\"Eminent Chinese of the Ch&#39;ing Period/\u0160urhaci\">\u0160urhaci</a></span>&#32;[<i>q.&#8239;v.</i>]. In 1652, at the age of twenty-two (<i>sui</i>), he was appointed a general in charge of an expedition against <span class=\"ws-authlkpl\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eminent_Chinese_of_the_Ch%27ing_Period/Ch%C3%AAng_Ch%27%C3%AAng-kung\" title=\"Eminent Chinese of the Ch&#39;ing Period/Ch\u00eang Ch&#39;\u00eang-kung\">Ch\u00eang Ch'\u00eang-kung</a></span>&#32;[<i>q.&#8239;v.</i>] and was given the title of Ting-y\u00fcan Ta-chiang-ch\u00fcn \u5b9a\u9060\u5927\u5c07\u8ecd. He succeeded in 1656 in inflicting damage on the enemy's fleet and returned the following year to Peking. His father had died two years previously, and he succeeded to his father's rank of Ch'in-wang, but the designation was changed from Ch\u00eang \u912d to Chien \u7c21. He himself died three years later, and in 1671 was given the posthumous name Ch'un \u7d14. His princedom was later inherited by his second son, <span class=\"ws-authlkpl\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eminent_Chinese_of_the_Ch%27ing_Period/Labu\" title=\"Eminent Chinese of the Ch&#39;ing Period/Labu\">Labu</a></span>&#32;[<i>q.&#8239;v.</i>].\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15431518\">.mw-parser-output .wst-rule{background-color:currentcolor;color:inherit;width:auto;margin:2px auto 2px auto;height:1px;overflow:hidden}.mw-parser-output .wst-rule.wst-rule-left{margin-left:0}.mw-parser-output .wst-rule.wst-rule-right{margin-right:0}.mw-parser-output .wst-rule.__uirule{background-color:#a2a9b1;color:inherit;border:0;margin-top:0.2em;margin-bottom:0.2em}</style><hr class=\"wst-rule wst-rule-left\" style=\"color:inherit;width:40%;\" />\n<p>[1/221/9a; 2/2/29a; 34/124/15a.]\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15431519\">.mw-parser-output .wst-right{text-align:right}</style><div class=\"wst-right\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\">\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">George A. Kennedy</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>"},"links":[{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period/Ch\u00eang Ch'\u00eang-kung"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period/Jirgalang"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period/J\u00ean-tsung"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period/Labu"},{"ns":0,"exists":"","*":"Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period/\u0160urhaci"},{"ns":102,"exists":"","*":"Author:Arthur W. Hummel"},{"ns":102,"exists":"","*":"Author:George A. Kennedy"}],"sections":[],"wikitext":{"*":"{{Eminent Chinese of the Ch'ing Period\n | volume   = 1\n | onlysection = jidu\n | previous = J\u00ean-tsung\n | next     = Jirgalang\n | from     = 409\n | to       = 409\n | notes    =\n | section_author = George A. Kennedy\n}}{{DEFAULTSORT:Jidu}}"}}}